WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A before-and-after story is easy to believe. But what happened to everyone else?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A new review compared clinical hypnosis with doing little—and with active alternatives.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Against inactive controls there was a modest benefit for pain. Against relaxation and other active practices, no clear advantage emerged.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Those results concern clinical pain, not Zen12 or better concentration.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before buying a recording, make one ordinary twelve-minute observation of your own work.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Keep the prediction and the result. Follow the source. Buy nothing unless the actual offer fits.
